cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use jspassgen for Python in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "jspassgen for Python: a native port of the jspassgen password generator core"
abstract: >-
  A native Python port of the jspassgen password and passphrase core,
  drawing randomness only from the operating system's CSPRNG through the
  secrets module, with no network access. In development: the current
  version provides the random port and its unbiased CSPRNG adapter.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.23"
